UPDATE companies SET description='Sigla Furniture operates from Los Angeles, California, where the company''s roots trace back to 1976 when the founder arrived from Iran. By 1980 he had opened a small woodworking workshop after initially importing Italian music boxes. The business remains a second-generation, family-owned custom furniture manufacturer, now led by the founders'' child. In 2022 the company expanded by acquiring JDM Furniture and Unfinished Chairs, adding founder Tom Juhasz and his decades of designer-focused experience.

The workshop produces traditional and transitional dining tables, sofas, chairs, and case goods, all custom-made to order using premium imported materials. Each piece is handcrafted in the Los Angeles facility, with typical production and delivery taking eight to ten weeks from order confirmation.

Sigla serves residential clients, interior designers, and large-scale hospitality projects. Commercial references include the Omni Hotel, the Shade Hotel, and Marriott properties, alongside individual homeowners seeking custom seating, tables, and case goods. The company works from client sketches or existing SKUs, adapting frames, upholstery, and finishes to project requirements.

The company emphasizes heirloom-quality craftsmanship intended to last generations, framing furniture as "a stitch in the tapestry of your family." A one-year Sigla Guarantee covers repairs for normal wear and tear, reflecting the founders'' goal to create the last piece of furniture a customer will ever need.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture manufacturing", "Handcrafted woodworking", "Custom upholstery", "Custom wood finishing", "Custom fabric and leather selection", "Hospitality furniture production", "Residential furniture production", "Interior design collaboration", "Custom design from sketches", "Warehouse pickup and delivery coordination"], "industries": ["Residential", "Hospitality", "Interior design", "Hotels", "Restaurants"], "materials": ["Premium imported woods", "Fabrics", "Leathers", "Wood finishes"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "8 to 10 weeks from order confirmation", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom-made to order with 8\u201310 week production lead time", "Heirloom-quality craftsmanship using premium imported materials", "Second-generation family ownership with over 40 years of operation", "Proven hospitality portfolio including Omni Hotel, Shade Hotel, and Marriott", "Los Angeles workshop offering warehouse pickup and scheduled delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founder arrived from Iran in 1976 -> /about-us", "Workshop opened by 1980 after importing Italian music boxes -> /about-us", "Wife joined in 1994, streamlined production and organized office -> /about-us", "Second-generation family-owned custom furniture manufacturer -> /about-us", "2022 acquisition of JDM Furniture and Unfinished Chairs, added Tom Juhasz -> /about-us", "Specializes in traditional and transitional dining tables, sofas, chairs, case goods -> /", "Made in USA with premium imported materials -> /", "Custom-made to order, 8-10 week production and delivery timeframe -> /about-us", "Serves residential, hospitality, inter