UPDATE companies SET description='Solar On Earth is headquartered in Chelmsford, Massachusetts, with a secondary office in Chadwick, Illinois. The company operates a community solar program that enables residential and commercial customers to subscribe to local solar farms without installing rooftop panels. Founding year and ownership details are not publicly disclosed.

