UPDATE companies SET description='Solar Panel Company operates from Boston, Massachusetts, serving homeowners across Greater Boston and surrounding Massachusetts communities. The company has spent years helping residents transition to renewable energy, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed. It is structured as a locally based service provider with an in-house team of certified solar and roofing professionals.

