UPDATE companies SET description='Sonrise Apparel Services operates from Dallas, Texas, where Nicole Beavers founded the company in 2005. A Women’s Business Enterprise (WBE) certified, woman-owned business, it began after Beavers experienced repeated frustration with inefficient, dishonest cutting and sewing contractors while managing production for apparel brands. She launched Sonrise to provide a vertically integrated, communication-first alternative.

The company functions as a vertical contract cutting and sewing shop, handling product development, bulk cutting, die cutting on a hydraulic die press, hot strip cutting, sewing, marker and pattern plotting, assembly, packaging, pick-and-pack, and warehousing. It advertises medium to large contract capabilities with typical turnaround times of four to six weeks.

