UPDATE companies SET description='Southern Metal Fabricators is based in Albertville, Alabama. The company was founded in 1991 by Charles Bailey as a two-man shop serving maintenance and light fabrication needs of local industry. It remains family-owned, with Bailey''s sons Ashton and Whitton now involved in the business.

The company provides custom carbon steel, stainless steel, and aluminum fabrication for industrial applications. Its capabilities span design, cutting, forming, welding, finishing, and assembly, with in-house detailing using AutoCAD, MTC Shape Cutting, and Pro Nest software. The 130,000-square-foot high-bay production building sits on six acres of laydown yard and is served by four overhead cranes (up to 10 tons) and a 35-ton gantry crane, enabling fabrication of platforms, handrails, bulk storage tanks, silos, hoppers, ductwork, conveyor structures, and material handling equipment.

Southern Metal Fabricators serves a broad range of industries including agriculture, architecture, automotive, cement, construction, coal and biomass, egg and poultry, feed and grain, iron and steel, mining and quarry, marine, petroleum, paper, plastics, power generation, retail, utilities, and woodworking. Past projects include structural fabrication for ThyssenKrupp''s steel manufacturing facility in Alabama.

The company emphasizes a "tool up to handle any custom metal fabrication job, start to finish, right here on the premises" philosophy. Differentiators include pre-assembly and test-running before shipping, a dedicated point of contact for the life of each project, and an in-house quality inspector overseeing every step.', certifications=ARRAY['ASME Section IX','API 650','AWS D1.1 (carbon steel)','AWS D1.2 (aluminum)','AWS D1.6 (stainless steel)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural Steel Fabrication", "Custom Welding Services", "In-House Detailing Services", "Design (AutoCAD, MTC Shape Cutting, Pro Nest)", "Cutting", "Forming", "Assembly", "Finishing (hot-dip galvanizing, priming, painting)", "Silo Fabrication", "Industrial Ductwork Fabrication", "Bulk Storage Tank Fabrication", "Hopper Fabrication", "Platform Fabrication", "Conveyor Structure Fabrication", "Material Handling Equipment Fabrication", "Steel Ladle Fabrication", "Industrial Access Fabrication (ladders, stairs, platforms)", "Pollution Control Equipment Fabrication", "Dust Collector System Fabrication"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Architecture", "Automotive", "Cement", "Construction", "Coal & Biomass", "Egg & Poultry", "Feed & Grain", "Iron & Steel", "Mining & Quarry", "Marine", "Petroleum", "Paper", "Plastics", "Power Generation", "Retail", "Utilities", "Woodworking"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Galvanized steel", "Copper"], "equipment": ["130,000 sq ft high-bay production building", "6-acre laydown yard", "Overhead cranes (2-ton, 3-ton, 10-ton)", "Gantry crane (35-ton)", "MTC Shape Cutting system"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Pre-assembly and test-run before shipping", "Dedicated point of contact for project lifetime", "Works with carbon steel, stainless steel, and aluminum", "Handles projects from small transfer carts to immense bulk hoppers", "In-house detailing and quality inspection under one roof"], "facts_used"