UPDATE companies SET description='Southern Motion was founded in 1996 in Pontotoc, Mississippi, by Guy Lipscomb and his wife Sandy. The company took its name from a painting titled "Southern Motion" they encountered while shopping, which embodied the spirit of relaxation and comfort that would define their product line.

The company manufactures reclining furniture exclusively, including sofas, recliners, sectionals, and accent chairs with features such as power headrests, massage and heat, and wireless charging. Operations span five facilities in northern Mississippi, employing more than 1,500 workers. Southern Motion emphasizes domestic production, describing its products as American made with both domestic and imported parts.

Southern Motion sells through independent retailers across the United States, Canada, and Mexico. Its customer base consists of furniture retailers who carry the brand''s motion furniture collections.

