UPDATE companies SET description='Specialized Switchgear Solutions operates from Mansfield, Ohio. Knox, a Six Sigma Blackbelt, had overseen manufacturing operations with up to 400 employees, while Smith led special projects, field service, and parts management. Their combined experience spans assembly, design, quality assurance, and customer support across medium‑voltage switchgear.

