UPDATE companies SET description='Specialty Plastics Inc. operates from St. Peters, Missouri, where it was started in 1980 as a full‑service injection molder. The company has spent more than four decades supplying tight‑tolerance plastic parts to a broad range of businesses, building its reputation on a partnership‑first philosophy that ties its growth directly to customer success.

The shop specializes in custom plastic injection molding and extends its capabilities to blow molding, thermoset molding, insert molding, and over molding. An in‑house tool and mold shop handles tooling design, CAD‑based prototype development, and production tooling. Twenty‑one molding machines are networked to a central computer for real‑time process tracking, and the plant runs 24 hours a day, five days a week.

The customer base spans medical instruments, automotive, healthcare, home appliances, sporting goods, electrical, electronics, industrial equipment, motor manufacturing, toys, and leisure equipment.

