UPDATE companies SET description='Spectra Wood Showroom operates from State College, Pennsylvania, where it has produced solid wood furniture for 45 years. The company traces its roots to a commitment to value-driven design and practical construction, though a specific founding year and founder names are not publicly disclosed.

