UPDATE companies SET description='Founded more than a century ago in St. Louis, Missouri, the St. Louis Spring Company has operated continuously as a second‑generation family‑owned business. The shop specializes in handcrafted leaf‑spring suspension systems for virtually any vehicle type, maintaining time‑honored fabrication methods throughout its history.

