UPDATE companies SET description='Standard Supply Electronics operates from South Salt Lake, Utah, as an independent distributor of electronic components. The company is a member of the Edge Group, a distributor-owned buying and marketing group headquartered in Houston, Texas, that comprises more than 100 independent distributors and offers access to over 200 product lines from manufacturers.

The company stocks thousands of electronic components across categories such as soldering supplies, connectors, transistors, cables, heat-shrink tubing, diodes, batteries, fuses, tools, capacitors, banana plugs, and resistors. Beyond its own webstore, Standard Supply Electronics sells through Amazon and eBay marketplaces, extending its reach to customers who prefer those platforms.

