UPDATE companies SET description='State Wire & Terminal, Inc. was founded in 1973 and is headquartered in Auburn Hills, Michigan, just outside Detroit. The company began as a distributor of electrical components for maintenance and repair applications.

More than 12,000 items are available for same-day shipping. In addition to electrical components, State Wire & Terminal offers a line of storage solutions including component kit boxes, bearing racks, bins, and wire spool racks. An inventory management system helps customers anticipate needs and avoid stockouts, and a Will Call counter at the Auburn Hills facility allows for immediate pickup of hundreds of items.

