UPDATE companies SET description='Stevens Equipment Supply is a wholesale distributor headquartered in Eagan, Minnesota. The company traces its roots to 1960 when Don Stevens founded the business as a manufacturer''s representative for the dairy industry. Incorporated as Donald Stevens, Inc. in 1970, the firm transitioned to distribution in 1977, adding food service equipment to its lineup. In 1981 it began supplying packaged terminal air conditioners to the lodging sector, and in 2001 entered the HVAC market through a partnership with Goodman. The company was renamed Stevens Equipment Supply and relocated its headquarters in 2018.

Today the company distributes heating, ventilation, and air-conditioning equipment, parts, and supplies from brands such as Daikin, Goodman, and Amana. It operates 15 branches across Arizona, Colorado, Minnesota, Nevada, New Mexico, North Dakota, South Dakota, Utah, and Wisconsin. The distribution network supports online ordering, after-hours emergency service, warranty processing, commercial quoting, and bill payment. The staff provides technical training and issues service bulletins to keep contractors informed.

Primary customers are HVAC contractors serving the residential and light commercial markets, as well as the hospitality industry that relies on packaged terminal air conditioners. Its regional branches stock inventory tailored to local contractor needs.

